        <mxCell id="legend" value="MASCO and ISCO codes may describe different jobs: code equality alone is not sufficient. Interview bank uses MASCO; no enforced occupation FK.&#10;PK = primary key | FK = enforced foreign key | UQ = unique | ? = nullable/optional&#10;Blue solid: FK (parent 1 or 0..1 -&gt; child 0..N / 0..1). Orange dashed: application association / embedded record." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="78" width="1440" height="66" />
